    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald is delighted to present No 20 Summerseat Green to the market, an own door two-bedroom ground floor apartment situated in a well sought after residential development. This impressive property benefits from being in walking distance to the Clonee Village and is sure to appeal to first time buyers, and to those trading down. \n \nThe accommodation comprises of an entrance porch, spacious light filled living / dining room with double doors positioned to the front of the property. A fully fitted kitchen offers a wealth of countertop and storage space. Two bedrooms with built in wardrobes (main en-suite) are located to the rear of the property, and a large bathroom with utility cupboard plumbed for a washing machine completes the accommodation. \n \nSummerseat is a relatively small development and is located on a mature site with picturesque walkways and open areas, it is well maintained and is in a very convenient location situated close to the village of Clonee, benefiting from the best that village life has to offer with Dunboyne and Blanchardstown S.C. also just a stone's throw away. Shops, supermarkets, restaurants, bars, hairdressers, public transport, beauty salons, and much more are almost on your doorstep and combined with the rural aspect of Co. Meath the new occupants will have the best of both worlds to enjoy. The M3 & M50 ensure commuting is extremely convenient and Dublin Airport is only a 15-20-minute drive away. Dunboyne Train station is also within a short distance.\n \nEarly viewing is highly recommended!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nLiving/Dining Room - 6.41m x 6.24m\nOpen light filled space with laminated flooring, electric fireplace, and double doors to the front of the property.\n\nKitchen - 3.73m x 1.97m\nA modern Kitchen with tiled flooring, built-in wall, and floor storage space, which includes a dishwasher, sink, oven and hob with extractor fan.\n\nBedroom 1 - 5.32m x 2.23m\nLarge double bedroom with laminate flooring, built-in wardrobes and an en-suite attached.\n\nEn-Suite - 2.13m x 1.29m\nFully tiled ensuite to include a wash hand basin, wc and a walk-in shower.\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.27m x 1.92m\nSingle bedroom with built in wardrobe, laminate flooring.\n\nBathroom - 2.13m x 1.64m\nFully tiled floor to wall, the bathroom includes a bult in utility cupboard, W.C, wash hand basin and a shower unit.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Own-door ground floor apartment</li><li>Two spacious bedrooms with built-in wardrobes</li><li>Principal bedroom with en-suite shower room</li><li>Bright and generously proportioned living/dining room</li><li>Double doors opening to the front of the property</ul>"
      },
